Synapse-32 board files for Buildroot.

synapse32.dts  device tree (CPU, 256 MB DRAM, CLINT, PLIC, 16550 UART)
synapse32.dtb  compiled copy that OpenSBI embeds and passes to the kernel.
               After editing the .dts, regenerate it:
                   dtc -I dts -O dtb -o synapse32.dtb synapse32.dts
linux.fragment kernel options on top of rv32_defconfig
post-image.sh  writes images/synapse.bin (for the board) and images/synapse.hex (simulator)
